### 解决方案三：修复符文页热注入在“当前选中系统预设页且自定义槽位已满”时的失败 Bug

#### 问题根因
`src-tauri/src/lib.rs` 的 `inject_lcu_rune_page` 只尝试 `DELETE` 当前激活页 `currentpage`。如果当前激活页是系统内置不可删除页（`isDeletable: false`），且玩家的自定义符文页数量已达上限，随后的 `POST /lol-perks/v1/pages` 会直接返回 `400 Bad Request`。

#### 修改文件：`src-tauri/src/lib.rs`（`inject_lcu_rune_page` 方法）

```rust
    /// 6. Hot-injects a complete 9-perk Rune Page into LCU with fallback slot eviction
    pub async fn inject_lcu_rune_page(
        &self,
        page_name: &str,
        primary_style_id: i32,
        sub_style_id: i32,
        selected_perk_ids: Vec<i32>,
    ) -> Result<Value, String> {
        let creds = self
            .credentials
            .read()
            .await
            .clone()
            .ok_or_else(|| "LCU not connected".to_string())?;

        let mut deleted_any = false;

        // 1. 优先检查当前激活页是否可删除
        if let Ok(curr) = self
            .lcu_client
            .lcu_request(
                &creds,
                Method::GET,
                "/lol-perks/v1/currentpage",
                None,
                &self.ring_buffer,
            )
            .await
        {
            let is_deletable = curr
                .get("isDeletable")
                .and_then(|v| v.as_bool())
                .unwrap_or(false);
            if is_deletable {
                if let Some(page_id) = curr.get("id").and_then(|v| v.as_i64()) {
                    deleted_any = self
                        .lcu_client
                        .lcu_request(
                            &creds,
                            Method::DELETE,
                            &format!("/lol-perks/v1/pages/{}", page_id),
                            None,
                            &self.ring_buffer,
                        )
                        .await
                        .is_ok();
                }
            }
        }

        // 2. 如果当前页是系统内置页(不可删)，遍历全部符文页找到旧的 NexusAkari 页或第一个可删页并删除
        if !deleted_any {
            if let Ok(pages_val) = self
                .lcu_client
                .lcu_request(
                    &creds,
                    Method::GET,
                    "/lol-perks/v1/pages",
                    None,
                    &self.ring_buffer,
                )
                .await
            {
                if let Some(pages) = pages_val.as_array() {
                    let target_page = pages
                        .iter()
                        .find(|p| {
                            p.get("isDeletable").and_then(|v| v.as_bool()) == Some(true)
                                && p.get("name")
                                    .and_then(|n| n.as_str())
                                    .map(|n| n.contains("NexusAkari") || n.contains("OP.GG"))
                                    .unwrap_or(false)
                        })
                        .or_else(|| {
                            pages.iter().find(|p| {
                                p.get("isDeletable").and_then(|v| v.as_bool()) == Some(true)
                            })
                        });

                    if let Some(page_id) = target_page.and_then(|p| p.get("id")).and_then(|v| v.as_i64()) {
                        let _ = self
                            .lcu_client
                            .lcu_request(
                                &creds,
                                Method::DELETE,
                                &format!("/lol-perks/v1/pages/{}", page_id),
                                None,
                                &self.ring_buffer,
                            )
                            .await;
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        // 3. 创建并激活新符文页
        let payload = json!({
            "name": page_name,
            "primaryStyleId": primary_style_id,
            "subStyleId": sub_style_id,
            "selectedPerkIds": selected_perk_ids,
            "current": true
        });
        self.lcu_client
            .lcu_request(
                &creds,
                Method::POST,
                "/lol-perks/v1/pages",
                Some(payload),
                &self.ring_buffer,
            )
            .await
    }
